# ── Cesium ion (optional) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Access tokens for the photorealistic 3D city layer, from https://ion.cesium.com/tokens
# with the "assets:read" scope. Several may be listed, comma separated; each retry advances
# to the next. Note that ion issues every token on an account the same shared Google key, so
# extra tokens buy resilience against a revoked token, not extra imagery quota. Without any
# token the 3D CITY toggle is hidden and the graphite vector map is the only basemap.
VITE_CESIUM_ION_TOKEN=

# ── Backend origin (deployment only) ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Leave EMPTY for local development: the Vite proxy forwards /api and /ws to localhost:8000.
# Set it to the deployed backend's origin (no trailing slash) when the frontend is hosted
# separately, e.g. https://skyguard-backend.onrender.com
VITE_API_BASE=
